#     """Track fills by diffing open-orders snapshots (best-effort).
#
#     Many exchanges expose open orders easily, but do not push fills unless you
#     listen to user streams. If an order fills later, it disappears from the
#     open-orders list. Without tracking, the bot may never notice the fill and
#     your dashboard trade count stays 0.
