# ============================================================
# USER EXTENSIONS PACK - WORLD-CLASS MOBILE & QUANTUM MODULES
# (Lightweight, Termux-friendly implementations)
# ============================================================
#
# NOTE:
# These classes implement the high-level architecture the user requested:
# - MobileNeuralNetwork (TFLite + lightweight fallback)
# - TradingAgents (multi-specialist heuristic agents)
# - DeepRLTrader (stub-friendly DQN-style skeleton)
# - AdvancedSentimentAnalyzer (multi-lingual wrapper on BasicSentiment)
# - SelfImprovingSystem (meta-performance loop)
# - QuantumRiskManager (VaR + quantum Monte Carlo style wrapper)
# - MobileOptimizer (profile selector on top of SmartResourceManager/psutil)
# - GeopoliticalPredictor (async, news-style risk aggregation scaffold)
# - AIDashboard (3D-style ASCII portfolio mapper)
# - AlgorithmGenerator (genetic algorithm scaffold)
# - TimeSeriesTransformerLite (small Transformer wrapper; original
#   TimeSeriesTransformer above remains the primary one)
# - QuantumTradingSignal (entanglement-style pair signal)
# - TraderAPI (async broadcast of signals to peers)
#
# They are designed to be OPTIONAL: if heavy deps (TensorFlow / tflite /
# PyTorch) are not available on Termux, they fall back to safe stubs.
