# - Implements Veto Genealogy for Best Flush diagnostics:
#   _pp_diag_last_veto_gene reports WHY best flush was rejected:
#     * SAFETY (safety gate / risk / veto-safety)
#     * NO_EDGE (flat/weak signal)
#     * THRESHOLD (edge below threshold)
# - Hardens _pp910_best_flush against None / malformed dicts via .get() + defaults.
# - Routes ALL errors through _pp200_heal (never raises).
# - Token-safe: does NOT modify any token/env keys.
